  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Stock Chart control is a specialized financial chart for visualizing stock market data with support for OHLC (Open-High-Low-Close) and Candlestick chart types. It includes built-in technical indicators (SMA, EMA, MACD, Bollinger Bands, RSI, Stochastic, ATR, etc.), trendlines, period selectors, range selectors, crosshair, trackball, zooming and panning, tooltip, and logarithmic axis. It is the ideal choice for building stock trading dashboards, financial analytics, and market data applications on ASP.NET Core.",
